 "notes": [
  "The api.census.gov data endpoint now returns a \"Missing Key\" page without an API key, so values were taken from the Census table-based summary files (same estimates). Files were streamed and only the header + SF county row kept. Variable labels come from the API groups metadata (no key needed).",
  "Universe for B08301/B08007: workers 16 years and over who LIVE in SF (residence geography). B08406/B08604: workers 16+ who WORK in SF (workplace geography).",
  "Mode = usual primary means of travel to work last week, longest-distance mode only; one commute trip type, not all trips. The 5-year window 2020-2024 includes pandemic years with very high work-from-home, so WFH is likely higher and transit lower than a 2024-only snapshot.",
  "Shares are computed here (count / total). shareOfCommuters_exclWFH divides by (total - worked from home). moe90 = published 90% margin of error.",
  "In B08406 taxi/ride-hailing, motorcycle and other means are a single category."
 ],
